                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Feel free to check my video about RAILED which include 2 play session of the game, the first one with commentary, some comments about the game while the second is my current high-score of 700m+ without commentary. It is very hard to get to that amount of score:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/PBqkWFocfOg\n\n[b]About the game:[/b]\n\nRailed is a fun puzzle game. The game is very simple yet it is great and enjoyable. The game is actually quite short, 15mins max each time you play it but it is replayable as every map different, the layout of the maps random, the received tracks are random. Let's see the + and - of the game from points to points:\n\n[b]+:[/b]\n\n+replayability\n+challenging to get a good score and satisfying to get one\n+railroad themed game with sound effects+music which goes well to it\n+fun, at least it was for me, it might be for you too if you like puzzle/logic games\n+it is actually quite cheap, good time waster game and you can play it if you have only 15mins for some short gaming session\n\n[b]-:[/b]\n\n-the luck factor is too annoying\n-because of the luck factor, I would like to see a few more features, more various purchasable tiles, joker tile, but according to developer these might be added in future\n\n[b]Overall Opinion[/b]\n\nThe game is enjoyable, it worth its price if you like such kind of games. On other hands this type of game probably don't have huge audience on PC, perhaps would sell more well as a phone game. I mean, it would be fun to play it while sitting on the train:-)\n\n[b]Hey, I am an achievement hunter! [/b]\n\nThis game is might not be for you. You probably not going to unlock all achievements, score related achievements, so the 500-600-700-800-900m scores are quite challenging, last few nearly impossible. If the game won't leave \"steam is learning about/profile limited\" status it won't affect your AVGC, but if you care about that stat perhaps this game isn't for you. Completion time is unpredictable, could be 10h, could be 1000h, or it is impossible to perfect. Why? Not only a good strategy and adaptation+logic skill required but also a huge amount of luck.\n\n[b]This review was created for Average Achievement Hunter curator [/b]\n\nFollow my curator if you like to see achievement-related information (completion time, difficulty to get all achievements) on the store page of the games.\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/curator/30168383-Average-Achievement-Hunter/ \n\nThe curator group doesn't mark any game as recommended so it shows useful information about achievements on the store page of the games without influencing the main store page of steam with recommendations + all games sorted to lists based on expected completion times. No point not to follow!:-)",
